The '''Imperial Navy Exclusion Zone''' was an area in the [[Abrion sector]] that was restricted by the [[Imperial Navy]] of the [[Galactic Empire]] which contained the Imperial stronghold [[planet]] [[Scarif]].<ref name="Dawn" />

